  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building knowledge to combat marine litter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is the creation of a structured and integrated strategy to elaborate a plan of monitoring and assessment of marine litter in the S&#xe3;o Paulo state, Brazil, which considers the establishment of an effective communication channel between science and management in order to aggregate initiatives and create opportunities for collective learning, considering decision makers and other stakeholders. The target group includes decision makers, NGOs, private sector and academia.</narrative>
  </description>
